title: State machine annotations
initial -> Idle
state Idle {
  entry: Reset()
}
choice Ready: Ready?
state Running {
  on Tick: Work()
}
state Fault
Idle -> Ready: Start
Ready -> Running: [ready]
Ready -> Fault: [else]
Running -> final: Stop
Fault -> final: Reset
note on Idle: Waiting for Start.\nReset runs on entry.
note on Ready width 180: Branch labels are descriptive guards.
note on final: Shared terminal state.
